, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116132827763007489/cmVAQGvN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 254, "status": 200, "title": "Rajasthan to Pilot India’s First Sodium-Ion BESS With GEAPP, JVVNL", "unwound_url": "https://www.saurenergy.com/solar-energy-news/rajasthan-to-pilot-indias-first-sodium-ion-bess-with-geapp-jvvnl-12767052", "url": "https://t.co/6ZCHi3FQbP"}]}, "id": "2116132827393822933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Rajasthan to Pilot India’s First Sodium-Ion #BESS With GEAPP, JVVNL.... The initiative will assess the performance and potential applications of sodium-ion storage in managing local peak demand and improving the utilisation of rooftop solar generation. https://t.co/6ZCHi3FQbP", "url": "https://x.com/Saur_energy/status/2116132827393822933"}, {"author_id": "816397863680765952", "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:31:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116176148883198282"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BFFN65mIHr", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Cdn_Mining_Jrnl/status/2116176148883198282/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116176145980747776", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/BFFN65mIHr"}]}, "id": "2116176148883198282", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Draslovka secures key IPs to strengthen sodium-ion supply chain\n\nDraslovka, through its US-based subsidiary Draslovka Mining, is set to acquire Natron Energy’s intellectual property (IP) for its Prussian Blue Analogue (PBA) and Prussian White Analogy (PWA) sodium-ion battery https://t.co/BFFN65mIHr", "url": "https://x.com/Cdn_Mining_Jrnl/status/2116176148883198282"}, {"author_id": "2084245956326006784", "created_at": "2026-10-30T17:36:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116222670085714167"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 174, "start": 172, "tag": "C"}, {"end": 235, "start": 223, "tag": "CleanEnergy"}, {"end": 240, "start": 236, "tag": "EVs"}, {"end": 256, "start": 241, "tag": "Sustainability"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dbhFYGQzsR", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PrimeMediaSite/status/2116222670085714167/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116222504209375232", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/dbhFYGQzsR"}]}, "id": "2116222670085714167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚡ TECH INTEL: Sodium ion batteries could make EVs more affordable!\n\nBYD and GAC are testing sodium ion batteries. Can they revolutionize EV prices? Find out in our report. #C...\n\n🧵 Full investigation &amp; metrics below 👇\n\n#CleanEnergy #EVs #Sustainability https://t.co/dbhFYGQzsR", "url": "https://x.com/PrimeMediaSite/status/2116222670085714167"}, {"author_id": "22271644", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:13:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115914838098452973"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 212, "start": 198, "tag": "ACPRECHARGE26"}], "mentions": [{"end": 176, "id": "1707538041131483136", "start": 161, "username": "peakenergytech"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pl2FxSsxSn", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/USCleanPower/status/2115914838098452973/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115914835430891520", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/pl2FxSsxSn"}]}, "id": "2115914838098452973", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 478, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Alternatives to lithium-ion batteries are fast emerging, perhaps none as quickly as its close cousin sodium-ion. 🔋\n\nPlatts Senior Reporter Garrett Hering joined @peakenergytech’s Landon Mossburg at #ACPRECHARGE26 to discuss the future of sodium-ion batteries — check it out on https://t.co/pl2FxSsxSn", "url": "https://x.com/USCleanPower/status/2115914838098452973"}, {"author_id": "2066504343046557696", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:28:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116371779732283748"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 241, "start": 238, "tag": "EV"}, {"end": 264, "start": 242, "tag": "BidirectionalCharging"}, {"end": 276, "start": 265, "tag": "EVCharging"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cxbolB5cy3", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/evfuturenews/status/2116371779732283748/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116371763126849536", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/cxbolB5cy3"}]}, "id": "2116371779732283748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ford says the forthcoming Fathom electric pickup will have a built-in inverter for bidirectional charging; its starting MSRP is $28,350. Ford is working with utilities on a grid-interconnection process before production begins next year. #EV #BidirectionalCharging #EVCharging\n... https://t.co/cxbolB5cy3", "url": "https://x.com/evfuturenews/status/2116371779732283748"}, {"author_id": "132816632", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:44:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116541866350985308", "2116556162317287877"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 8, "start": 1, "tag": "Sodium"}, {"end": 43, "start": 35, "tag": "lithium"}], "urls": [{"description": "Sodium-ion was supposed to replace lithium-ion. Instead, it may be learning to live alongside it. CATL’s Naxtra sodium-ion cells have reached approximately 175 Wh/kg, still below the ~205 Wh/kg benchmark for LFP. Yet commercial momentum is building, including a 3-year, 60 GWh energy storage agreement, with domestic deliveries planned for September 2026 and global deliveries expected from June 2027. Why does sodium-ion matter? Reduced dependence on lithium, strong low-temperature performance, and greater supply-chain diversification. For stationary storage, energy density is generally less critical than system cost, operating performance, and lifetime economics. But challenges remain. Sodium-ion manufacturing capacity is still small compared with lithium-ion, while supply chains and cost competitiveness need further development. According to the IEA, promising near-term applications include cold-climate markets, selected stationary storage applications, and hybrid sodium-lithium systems", "display_url": "lnkd.in/p/ddhPeH2Z", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://lnkd.in/p/ddhPeH2Z", "images": [{"height": 512, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116541869400178688/TZimsi9-?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 540}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116541869400178688/TZimsi9-?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 110, "status": 200, "title": "#solarenergy #energystorage #sodiumion #sodium #bess #batterytechnology | Tom Wu", "unwound_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/tom-wu-75239331_solarenergy-energystorage-sodiumion-share-7521474440338206720-Imr_/?highlightedUpdateUrn=urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7521474441600729089&highlightedUpdateType=SOCIAL_SHARE&origin=SOCIAL_SHARE&utm_source=social_share_send&utm_medium=android_app&rcm=ACoAAAK72nMBp3F7M0oYS4_U0HlvYhRS_kFCuFM&utm_campaign=share_via", "url": "https://t.co/sMgovuEEWQ"}]}, "id": "2116541866350985308", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 386, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"#Sodium-ion doesn't need to kill  #lithium-ion batteries. I needs to prove where it creates distinct value.\"\nhttps://t.co/sMgovuEEWQ", "url": "https://x.com/jczuleta/status/2116541866350985308"}, {"author_id": "1608813562029559808", "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116045044268560454"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "This work demonstrates an intrinsically stretchable thin-film rechargeable Na-ion battery by addressing the materials challenges and integration compatibilities across the whole battery system. The design combines biocompatible materials selection and organic Na-ion electrochemical system design, with a solvent-resistant stretchable current collector, a strain-adaptable gel polymer electrolyte, and tunable-modulus organic electrodes. It presents a promising platform for next-generation thin-film stretchable power sources for wearable and biomedical electronic devices.", "display_url": "cell.com/matter/abstrac…", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/matter/abstract/S2590-2385(26)00432-7?rss=yes", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116045051201736704/up2BYm_c?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116045051201736704/up2BYm_c?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 108, "status": 200, "title": "An intrinsically stretchable thin-film organic rechargeable sodium-ion battery enabled for wearable devices", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/matter/abstract/S2590-2385(26)00432-7?rss=yes", "url": "https://t.co/czm9w5YQma"}]}, "id": "2116045044268560454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 232, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "An intrinsically stretchable thin-film organic rechargeable sodium-ion battery enabled for wearable devices\nhttps://t.co/czm9w5YQma", "url": "https://x.com/EKL_Batteries/status/2116045044268560454"}, {"author_id": "794541866968616960", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:12:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116533861966385612"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Storion Energy highlighted its battery technology at CES 2026.", "display_url": "electronicdesign.com/technologies/p…", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://www.electronicdesign.com/technologies/power/power-supply/batteries/product/55344112/electronic-design-vanadium-redox-flow-battery-delivers-long-duration-energy-storage", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/n